# ONNX Layer

- ONNX infrastructure lives in `AudioSeparator.Onnx`, not Core
- `OnnxSeparator` exposes abstract hooks: `ReadInferenceSpec`, `CreateInferenceTask`
- Sample rate comes from `SeparationRequirements`, not from the ONNX model
- Demucs backend: `AudioSeparator.Onnx.Demucs` — waveform I/O
- MDX backend: `AudioSeparator.Onnx.Mdx` — host STFT + spectrogram I/O (Inst_HQ_5 defaults)
- DSP (resample, peak normalize, clip prevention) lives in Core, not NAudio/FFMPEG
